 "intro": "At four in the morning the minus-eighty stood open, its light a thin blue blade across the tiles, and the usual low hum had flattened into something apologetic. The postdocs are moving between the racks with their sleeves pulled over their hands, not so much working as waiting for the thaw to finish explaining itself. Half the boxes are ruined, slush and paper labels; the other half have started talking, in low confident voices that only stop when someone approaches. In the office the damage log has already been opened, the same ruled book as every term. Someone has made a first entry for each affected box, and after every box name the page shows two short columns of figures, the second of which no one has needed to read before.",
